    "description": "Sam Abrams is a witty, studious, and street-smart high school senior from New York City, adjusting to a new reality after her family relocates to a rural southern community in Tennessee. Once the culture-shock wears off,  she stumbles into feelings for charming, yet wayward Dillon, a country boy, high school athlete with a maverick’s spirit. With Sam adamantly focused on her future, and Dillon contently stuck in idle, the two learn that sometimes the most unsuspecting people in life have the most meaningful impact.",
